lldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"yLh19zRsOYbs2ukRTEhkpA","review_id":"aj7l9QLhe7BGWblwyZXOlQ","date":"2021-12-05T18:36:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9485262036323547,"text_excerpt":"My husband and I finally got around to trying out The Chloe for dinner. We were immediately impressed by the ambiance. The inside of the building is so amazing. Similar to the Columns hotel down the street but with more modern wall colors and decor. We tried the shrimp étouffée dumplings, the wild mushroom dirty rice, the blackened butter crusted speckled trout, and ice cream sandwich for dinner. Everything was good, but nothing impressed us except the ice cream sandwich. We felt that every dish was missing that wow factor. With that said, we were very impressed with the bar. Because the lounge area is so nice, we stayed for a drink after dinner. The bartenders did an excellent job with t..."},{"business_id":"yLh19zRsOYbs2ukRTEhkpA","review_id":"SBgY6N6E6v43nr-5V1GWhw","date":"2021-04-22T16:47:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9470435380935669,"text_excerpt":"Such an adorable spot and I can't wait to go back and continue getting a better sense of The Chloe with a stay and pool pass to full encompass The Chloe. My partner and I made a reservation for Monday evening the day of and were super appreciative they were able to squeeze us in. We initially asked for an 8/8:30pm timeslot, but they only had 6:45pm as their latest availability. The Chloe is a super boutique hotel hosting only 14 rooms within their estate right off of St. Charles and has such a whimsical vibe. The darker, muted tones makes it blend in yet stand out amongst the other properties in this area. I love their pantone colors of choice and it's just so damn perfect. There's a cour..."},{"business_id":"yLh19zRsOYbs2ukRTEhkpA","review_id":"PaQnFsBbsv01X58sEk4DDw","date":"2021-07-08T15:47:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9455337524414062,"text_excerpt":"I visited The Chloe for brunch with a friend and I had a wonderful time. The interior of the hotel main lobby and restaurant is stunning. There are so many cool places to sit and it is all very intimate. I started off with the Bloody Maria cocktail. It was bright green and had great flavor. Then we shared the shrimp etouffee dumplings. The dumplings are definitely very popular and rightly so because they were delicious. They were not spicy at all and had a great Creole/Asian fusion flavor. I had the chicken katsu sandwich as my entree and my friend had the eggs florentine. I Loved my sandwich. It consisted of a fried chicken cutlet with a bacon onion marmalade and lettuce on lightly toast..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"yLh19zRsOYbs2ukRTEhkpA","photo_id":"LJH4AolVE2bOmk-tVdIEwQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/LJH4AolVE2bOmk-tVdIEwQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.893369197845459},{"business_id":"yLh19zRsOYbs2ukRTEhkpA","photo_id":"00ooP78WGimjOr_VY55OLQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/00ooP78WGimjOr_VY55OLQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8684947490692139},{"business_id":"yLh19zRsOYbs2ukRTEhkpA","photo_id":"B51208Nq9ej-oQOcn1pqAw","label